{"id":"000VJF","title":"Malformed X-Renbans","author":"Jorava","solvedCount":9,"difficulty":2,"rating":"N/A","firstSeen":"2026-10-17T17:33:19+00:00","posted":"Gestern, 21:45 Uhr","rules":"Normal renbans, but you need to figure out how each line goes.\n\nSolve in Sudokupad\n\n---\n\nThe idea for this puzzle was inspired by a comment on an earlier puzzle of mine, which had branching renban lines, and a solver thought they were separate lines. That perspective never occurred to me until someone said it. This proves the value of feedback. It allows a setter to make better puzzles, improve the wording of the rules, and sometimes come up with new ideas for puzzles.\n\n---\n\nRules:\n\nNormal sudoku rules apply. Place the digits 1-9 in every row, column, and 3x3 box without repetition.\n\nRenban:\nDigits on a single purple line must be a consecutive set without repeats, but can be in any order.\n\nSpecial:\nIn this puzzle, each renban line shares exactly one cell with a different line. The 2 lines may cross each other or simply make a turn in the same cell. None of the lines branch or end in an intersection.","solutionCode":"Row 3","tags":["Sudoku","Renban (Variante)"],"links":[{"url":"https://sudokupad.app/0p7tqsq6ii","kind":"sudokupad"}],"data":"","error":null,"link":"https://sudokupad.app/0p7tqsq6ii","linkKind":"sudokupad","attempts":0,"fetched":"2026-10-17T20:41:39+00:00","settings":{},"summary":{"format":"scl","decoded":true,"rows":9,"cols":9,"cages":0,"hasSolution":true,"features":["lines"]}}